5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I worry we judge by sound, not by the daily friction on the floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,We treat staff time as free. Who actually absorbs the extra work?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We promise dates based on conditions we don't control. That’s risky.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The fund is committed before we know which budget pocket pays.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,We keep rediscovering the same lessons. Let’s look at past outcomes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
