12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the budget source matters, but the technical groundwork is the real trap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, true. But if the money isn't there, the groundwork is moot.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@All, let’s check the incident logs and the past rollout reviews.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
